                <li>This promotion applies only to MYR, IDR, THB account members;<br><br></li>
                <li>The promotion will be started from 21th August 2020 12:00:00 PM (GMT+8) until 21th September 2020 11:59:59 AM (GMT+8)<br><br></li>		
