                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                    <td style="border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;padding: 8px; text-align: center;color:#000000">21th August – 21th September 2020</td>
                    <td style="border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;padding: 8px; text-align: center;color:#000000">Apple iPhone 11 (64GB) </td>
                </tr>
                </table>
                <br><br></li>
                <li>Each currency will born Two (2) Winner, and it will be Random Generated by System (RNG).<br><br></li>
